# Manifold level 10
# The wall's two gates (stage 5h): the second level, at a quarter past five. A wider yard; the attackers
# come in by two gates at once, west and east, four waves; crates and low walls to hold behind; a bolt,
# a shotgun and a launcher on their racks. An ambient of 0.5.
